<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Newsletter Bestio - Découvertes de la semaine</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }
        .container {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5A3C, #A0522D);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 28px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 30px 20px;
        }
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            padding-bottom: 25px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        .section:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .section-title {
            color: #8B5A3C;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .section-icon {
            margin-right: 10px;
            font-size: 24px;
        }
        .article-item {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding: 15px;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid #8B5A3C;
        }
        .article-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #8B5A3C;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .article-title a {
            color: #8B5A3C;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .article-title a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .article-excerpt {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .article-meta {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .featured-species {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #f8f9fa, #e9ecef);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .species-name {
            color: #8B5A3C;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .species-latin {
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .stats-grid {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .stat-item {
            text-align: center;
        }
        .stat-number {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #8B5A3C;
        }
        .stat-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
        }
        .btn {
            background: #8B5A3C;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background: #6d3f2f;
        }
        .footer {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #8B5A3C;
        }
        .unsubscribe {
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding-top: 15px;
            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
        }
        .question-item {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding: 15px;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid #8B5A3C;
        }
        .question-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #8B5A3C;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .question-title a {
            color: #8B5A3C;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .question-title a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .question-meta {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- En-tête -->
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🐾 Newsletter Bestio</h1>
            <p>Découvertes de la {{ content.date|date('W') }}ème semaine de {{ content.date|date('Y') }}</p>
            <p style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 15px;">
                Envoyée le {{ content.date|date('d/m/Y') }} à {{ subscription.email }}
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <!-- Articles récents -->
            {% if content.recentArticles %}
            <div class="section">
                <h2 class="section-title">
                    <span class="section-icon">📝</span>
                    Articles récents
                </h2>
                {% for article in content.recentArticles %}
                    <div class="article-item">
                        <div class="article-title">
                            <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('show_article', {id: article.id})) }}">
                                {{ article.titreArticle }}
                            </a>
                        </div>
                        {% if article.dateArticle %}
                        <div class="article-meta">
                            Publié le {{ article.dateArticle|date('d/m/Y') }}
                            {% if article.redacteur %}par {{ article.redacteur.pseudo }}{% endif %}
                        </div>
                        {% endif %}
                        <div class="article-excerpt">
                            {% if article.contenuArticle %}
                                {{ article.contenuArticle|striptags|slice(0, 150) }}...
                            {% else %}
                                Découvrez cet article passionnant sur le monde animal.
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>
                        <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('show_article', {id: article.id})) }}" class="btn">Lire la suite</a>
                    </div>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
            {% endif %}

            <!-- Espèce mise en avant -->
            {% if content.featuredSpecies %}
            <div class="section">
                <h2 class="section-title">
                    <span class="section-icon">🦎</span>
                    Espèce mise en avant
                </h2>
                <div class="featured-species">
                    <div class="species-name">{{ content.featuredSpecies.nomEspece }}</div>
                    {% if content.featuredSpecies.description %}
                    <p>{{ content.featuredSpecies.description|striptags|slice(0, 200) }}...</p>
                    {% endif %}
                    <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('app_show_espece', {nom: content.featuredSpecies.classe.nom, nom_espece: content.featuredSpecies.nomEspece})) }}" class="btn">Découvrir cette espèce</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}

            <!-- Questions populaires -->
            {% if content.popularQuestions %}
            <div class="section">
                <h2 class="section-title">
                    <span class="section-icon">💬</span>
                    Questions populaires
                </h2>
                {% for question in content.popularQuestions %}
                    <div class="question-item">
                        <div class="question-title">
                            <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('app_forum_question_show', {nom_espece: question.espece.nomEspece, id: question.id})) }}">
                                {{ question.titreQuestion }}
                            </a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="question-meta">
                            {% if question.author %}Par {{ question.author.pseudo }}{% endif %}
                            {% if question.createdAt %} • {{ question.createdAt|date('d/m/Y') }}{% endif %}
                            {% if question.posseder|length > 0 %} • {{ question.posseder|length }} réponse{% if question.posseder|length > 1 %}s{% endif %}{% endif %}
                        </div>
                        <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('app_forum_question_show', {nom_espece: question.espece.nomEspece, id: question.id})) }}" class="btn">Voir la discussion</a>
                    </div>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
            {% endif %}

            <!-- Statistiques -->
            <div class="section">
                <h2 class="section-title">
                    <span class="section-icon">📊</span>
                    Bestio en chiffres
                </h2>
                <div class="stats-grid">
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <div class="stat-number">{{ content.stats.totalSpecies|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }}</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Espèces</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <div class="stat-number">{{ content.stats.totalArticles }}</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Articles</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <div class="stat-number">{{ content.stats.totalQuestions }}</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Questions</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <div class="stat-number">{{ content.stats.subscribers }}</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Abonnés</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Section découverte -->
            <div class="section">
                <h2 class="section-title">
                    <span class="section-icon">🔍</span>
                    Explorez Bestio
                </h2>
                <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 15px;">
                    <div style="text-align: center;">
                        <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('app_article')) }}" class="btn">📚 Tous les articles</a>
                    </div>
                    <div style="text-align: center;">
                        <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('app_classe')) }}" class="btn">🦋 Base d'espèces</a>
                    </div>
                    <div style="text-align: center;">
                        <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('app_forum')) }}" class="btn">💬 Forum</a>
                    </div>
                    <div style="text-align: center;">
                        <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('app_home')) }}" class="btn">🏠 Accueil</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pied de page -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>
                <strong>Bestio</strong> - Votre communauté passionnée d'animaux<br>
                <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('app_home')) }}">Visiter le site</a> • 
                <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('app_forum')) }}">Rejoindre le forum</a> •
                <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('app_article')) }}">Lire les articles</a>
            </p>
            
            <div class="unsubscribe">
                <p>
                    Vous recevez cette newsletter car vous êtes abonné(e) avec l'email <strong>{{ subscription.email }}</strong><br>
                    Fréquence : {{ subscription.frequency == 'weekly' ? 'Hebdomadaire' : (subscription.frequency == 'monthly' ? 'Mensuelle' : 'Quotidienne') }}<br>
                    <a href="{{ unsubscribeUrl }}">Se désabonner</a> • 
                    <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('newsletter_subscribe')) }}">Modifier mes préférences</a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>